<title>SRI LANKA: Korea Ceylon in rights announcement.</title>
<headline>Korea Ceylon in rights announcement.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Korea Ceylon Footwear Manufacturing Co Ltd said in a statement on Monday that it was making a rights issue of one new share for every two held.</p>
<p>The rights issue will be made at the par value of 10 rupees, the statement said.</p>
<p>After the rights issue, the company's issued share capital will rise to 19.9 million shares from the current 12.63 million, analysts said.</p>
<p>The firm's shares were last traded at 18.25 on May 2.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
